The legal texts are laws of the Republic of the Congo, taken from the Journal officiel de la
République du Congo as published by the Secrétariat général du Gouvernement (https://sgg.cg),
retrieved 29-30 October 2026.

Laws, court decisions and decisions of administrative authorities are outside the scope of
copyright in the Republic of the Congo. Loi n° 24-82 du 7 juillet 1982 sur le droit d'auteur et les
droits voisins, art. 14: "Nonobstant les dispositions des articles 6 et 7 ci-dessus, les lois, les
décisions de justice, celles des autorités administratives, ainsi que la traduction officielle de ces
textes et les nouvelles du jour publiées, radiodiffusées ou communiquées au public, sont hors du
champ d'application de la présente loi."
The site sgg.cg states no reuse terms that restrict this, and its robots.txt allows automated access.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text of each act was read from the Journal officiel PDF, its two
columns joined into paragraphs, hyphenated line breaks rejoined, and each version converted to one
Markdown file per article, with one paragraph per line, and arranged as git commits dated on the day
the change took effect. The wording of the law was not changed. The Secrétariat général du
Gouvernement does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
